{"version":"1","title":"Quadratic Formula","scenes":[{"beats":[{"component":"formula_derivation","params":{"title":"Derive x = (-b +/- sqrt(b^2 - 4ac)) / 2a","steps":["ax^2 + bx + c = 0","x^2 + (b/a)x = -c/a","x^2 + (b/a)x + (b/2a)^2 = (b/2a)^2 - c/a","(x + b/2a)^2 = (b^2 - 4ac) / 4a^2","x + b/2a = +/- sqrt(b^2 - 4ac) / 2a","x = (-b +/- sqrt(b^2 - 4ac)) / 2a"],"highlight":[0,5]},"caption":"Step-by-step derivation of the quadratic formula by completing the square."}]}]}
